{"book":"psalms","num":62,"verses":[{"en":"Truly my soul waiteth upon God: from him cometh my salvation.","n":1,"sm":"Ua faailoa mai le faatuatua o Tavita i","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faailoa"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faatuatua"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Tavita"},{"en":"","sm":"i"}]},{"en":"He only is my rock and my salvation; he is my defence; I shall not be greatly moved.","n":2,"sm":"le Atua Ma le usu pese o Iutana. O le salamo a Tavita.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"usu"},{"en":"","sm":"pese"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Iutana."},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"salamo"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"Tavita."}]},{"en":"How long will ye imagine mischief against a man? ye shall be slain all of you: as a bowing wall shall ye be, and as a tottering fence.","n":3,"sm":"E moni lava, e faalologo loʻu agaga i luma o le Atua; mai ia te ia loʻu faaolataga.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"moni"},{"en":"","sm":"lava,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faalologo"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"agaga"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"luma"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Atua;"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"faaolataga."}]},{"en":"They only consult to cast him down from his excellency: they delight in lies: they bless with their mouth, but they curse inwardly. Selah.","n":4,"sm":"E moni lava, o ia loʻu papa, ma loʻu faaolataga, o loʻu ‘olo maualuga; e le faagaeeteleina aʻu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"moni"},{"en":"","sm":"lava,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"papa,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"faaolataga,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"‘olo"},{"en":"","sm":"maualuga;"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faagaeeteleina"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu."}]},{"en":"My soul, wait thou only upon God; for my expectation is from him.","n":5,"sm":"Tou te frosofi ea i le ta","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Tou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"frosofi"},{"en":"","sm":"ea"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ta"}]},{"en":"He only is my rock and my salvation: he is my defence; I shall not be moved.","n":6,"sm":"gata seia afea? E fasia ia e outou uma lava,","w":[{"en":"","sm":"gata"},{"en":"","sm":"seia"},{"en":"","sm":"afea?"},{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"fasia"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"outou"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"lava,"}]},{"en":"In God is my salvation and my glory: the rock of my strength, and my refuge, is in God.","n":7,"sm":"e pei o le pa ua tulolo, o le ai ua tuleia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"pei"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"pa"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"tulolo,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"tuleia."}]},{"en":"Trust in him at all times; ye people, pour out your heart before him: God is a refuge for us. Selah.","n":8,"sm":"E moni, ua latou filifilia ina ia tuleia o ia ai lona mamalu;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"moni,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"filifilia"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"tuleia"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"mamalu;"}]},{"en":"Surely men of low degree are vanity, and men of high degree are a lie: to be laid in the balance, they are altogether lighter than vanity.","n":9,"sm":"ua naunau i latou i le pepelo; ua latou faamanuia i o latou gutu, a ua fetuu i o latou loto. Sela.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"naunau"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm"